00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:29.760
- The way your body adapts

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.850
to darkness is by allowing your iris

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:35.190
to relax the muscle
surrounding your pupil,

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:36.420
