00:01:33.967 --> 00:01:35.995
"The security camera caught me at 3:00 AM.

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:36.900
I don't remember."

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:37.923
Oh, sleepwalking.

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:41.520
That's funny.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:42.870
This is actually fairly common.

00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:44.310
Not eating five bags

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:45.180
of fruit snacks.

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.520
Sleepwalking happens
during the non-REM phase

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.530
of your sleep, usually
happens an hour or two in.

00:01:49.530 --> 00:01:51.600
It's one of the deepest,
it's the deepest stage

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:52.433
of your sleep.

00:01:52.433 --> 00:01:53.266
People don't remember it.

00:01:53.266 --> 00:01:55.830
Usually someone else has to
alert them that it's happening.

00:01:55.830 --> 00:01:57.810
And studies show one in two people

00:01:57.810 --> 00:01:59.040
get injured sleepwalking,

00:01:59.040 --> 00:01:59.970
could be a minor injury,

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:00.990
but they still do get injured.

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:02.460
You wanna make sure that
if that's happening,

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:04.380
you figure out the
underlying reason as to why.

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:06.210
Stress is one of the leading factors.

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:08.520
- [Ryan] Right about now is
when time just completely

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:10.020
stopped being a thing for me.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:12.300
- So not having exposure
to light can actually

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:14.610
break your circadian rhythm,
your natural circadian rhythm

00:02:14.610 --> 00:02:16.170
of when you wake up, when you go to sleep

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:17.820
because there are sensors in your brain,

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:21.090
in your eye that get
triggered by light entering.

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:22.080
So that's why I always say that one

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:22.913
of the first things you should do

00:02:22.913 --> 00:02:23.880
in the morning upon waking

00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:25.230
is opening shades, getting bright light.

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:28.280
And I know not every area in
the world has access to that.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.487
So you could fake it with
some artificial light.

00:02:30.487 --> 00:02:32.520
"Testing if I'm still lactose intolerant."

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:33.720
Ah, this is gonna be a brutal test.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:34.553
